Flight tracks: Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0

The recorded arrivals in this folder (<id>.json, <id>.bin and index.json) are derived from the adsb.lol historical
archive (globe_history, https://www.adsb.lol/docs/open-data/historical/), published by adsb.lol under the Open
Database License v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Contains information from adsb.lol, made available under the ODbL.

Share-alike: if you publicly use an adapted version of these tracks, you must also offer that adapted database under
the ODbL. Keep this notice with the data.

What was done to the recordings (filtering to ADS-B positions, smoothing to 1 Hz, calibrating heights on the runway,
inferring attitude, configuration and lights; each channel's provenance is in its file's header), the single-aircraft
extracts they were baked from, and the other sources that entered the bake are listed in the repository's
data/flights/LICENSE and data/flights/lv/selection.json.
